#: ../../source/install.rst:372
msgid ""
"Please install spglib by following the instruction on the `spglib webpage"
" <https://atztogo.github.io/spglib/install.html>`_. Here, we assume "
"spglib is installed in ``$SPGLIB_ROOT``."
